# Open-Source Lab Intake

Do not execute arbitrary upstream repository HEAD directly in production.

Required intake path:
1. identify source and license,
2. verify commercial/hosting implications and attribution obligations,
3. pin commit/image digest,
4. review source/configuration appropriate to risk,
5. build in controlled CI,
6. scan/test the result,
7. generate SBOM/sign/signature evidence when feasible,
8. publish approved immutable artifact to controlled/private registry,
9. reference published artifact from a versioned Lab Manifest.

Store source URL, author, license, pinned revision and attribution metadata per lab version.
